<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>DocumentFragment</stron=
g>: Minimizes DOM operations to 1 per batch</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Lazy Loading</strong>: =
Only renders visible comments initially</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Intersection Observer</=
strong>: Efficient infinite scroll detection</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Template Reuse</strong>=
: Fast HTML string-based element creation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Management</stro=
ng>: Tracks rendered comments to avoid duplicates</li>
</ol>
